<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RESEARCH ALERT-Reinsurance a 'buy'.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RESEARCH ALERT-Reinsurance a 'buy'.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macquarie Equities has rated Reinsurance Australia Ltd a buy, saying its result for the first half of 1996 was above expectations.</p>
<p>&quot;Overall, ReAC's first half result was impressive, underpinned by 25 percent premium growth,&quot; Macquarie said in a report to clients.</p>
<p>&quot;Although ReAC's earnings growth is forecast to slow appreciably from currently extraordinary levels, further upside in the stock is expected as the risk profile of the business contracts in line with ReAC's maturing status,&quot; Macquarie said.  </p>
<p>Reinsurance's first half net profit rose to A$30.2 million from A$27.89 million the previous corresponding half year.</p>
<p>Reinsurance's share price was down five cents at A$3.65 at 1.45 p.m. (0345 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
